      "ID": "1",
      "Event Name": "Communist Insurgency",
      "Details": "Communist organizers turn propaganda networks and local agitation into control of vulnerable states. As their foothold deepens, agitation can harden into insurgent strongholds and lockdowns, raising the risk of revolt.\n\nGovernments can intervene locally or launch a broader emergency response. Delay gives the movement more chances to spread, stage unexpected uprisings, and draw the country toward revolution.",
      "Evo I": "Communist cells turn local unrest into sudden revolts. Strikes, clandestine committees, and armed breakaways make every communist-held district a possible center of insurrection.",
      "Evo II": "Worker circles gather after dark in mills, mines, and depots, binding revolutionary discipline to secret rites. Fear spreads through industrial districts as the movement gains new converts.",
      "Evo III": "Lockdown zones speak of one world revolution and treat distant uprisings as parts of the same struggle. Their whispers prepare new strongholds for a conflict that no border can contain.",
      "Evo IV": "",
      "Evo V": "",
      "World-End Scenario": "Whispers of the World Revolution lead the communist crisis into the separate World Revolution crisis, where controlled states may become revolutionary bases.",
      "Type": "Minor Fire-Once",
      "Chaos level": "1",
      "Cluster ID": "16",
      "Status": "Needs Testing"
    },
    {
      "ID": "91",
      "Event Name": "The Great Revolution",
      "Details": "Lenin returns with a third eye and an army of humanoid workers. The revolution spreads through states in proportion to communist support, while defecting communists gain power and slowly become part of the monster host. Stalin and Trotsky fight Lenin as the movement grows.",
      "Evo I": "",
      "Evo II": "",
      "Evo III": "",
      "Evo IV": "Strange worker strikes foreshadow Lenin's return. Later stages expose the anomalous forces, strengthen Lenin's powers, and draw communist leaders into the transformation.",
      "Evo V": "",
      "World-End Scenario": "",
      "Type": "Major",
      "Chaos level": "1",
      "Cluster ID": "",
      "Status": "To Be Reworked"
    }
